WEBVTT

secretary-001
00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:05.221
Welcome, School Secretary, share your
school’s own short link, with its crest,

secretary-002
00:00:05.221 --> 00:00:08.960
motto and colours, rather than a generic
school-code login.

secretary-003
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.612
Staff and parents use a registered phone
number and four-digit PIN, while only the

secretary-004
00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:18.890
owner uses email and password, and
guardians see linked children only.

secretary-005
00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:25.254
Help families tap Install school app for
the school’s own crest and name, or use

secretary-006
00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:28.300
Safari, Share, Add to Home Screen on
iPhone.

secretary-007
00:00:29.138 --> 00:00:33.094
Check admissions, guardian details,
sibling links and class transfers

secretary-008
00:00:33.094 --> 00:00:36.706
carefully, keeping learners with the
correct authorised roster.

secretary-009
00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:42.553
Conventional schools keep academic terms,
while Islamic or dual-stream schools can

secretary-010
00:00:42.553 --> 00:00:45.907
enable Tahfeez and Halqahs, with dual-role
teachers using

secretary-011
00:00:45.907 --> 00:00:48.320
My Class and My Subjects under one login.

secretary-012
00:00:49.421 --> 00:00:54.005
Teachers and Mu’allims draft attendance,
scores and memorization offline after

secretary-013
00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:58.883
online setup, then sync automatically on
reconnect, so wait for confirmation before

secretary-014
00:00:58.883 --> 00:01:00.235
front-office follow-up.

secretary-015
00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:06.157
Print only authorised reports, checking
that the same fixed A4 page scales across

secretary-016
00:01:06.157 --> 00:01:09.640
phone, tablet and computer with no clipped
print margins.
